{"speciesId":336,"names":{"fr":"Séviper","es":"Seviper","en":"Seviper","ja":"ハブネーク"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SEVIPER shares a generations-long feud with ZANGOOSE. The scars on its body are evidence of vicious battles. This POKéMON attacks using its sword- edged tail."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SEVIPER’s swordlike tail serves two purposes - it slashes foes and douses them with secreted poison. This POKéMON will not give up its long- running blood feud with ZANGOOSE."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"SEVIPER and ZANGOOSE are eternal rivals. It counters a ZANGOOSE’s dazzling agility with its swordlike tail, which also oozes a horrible poison."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It sharpens its swordlike tail on hard rocks. It hides in tall grass and strikes unwary prey with venomous fangs."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It sharpens its swordlike tail on hard rocks. It hides in tall grass and strikes unwary prey with venomous fangs."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"For many generations, it has feuded with ZANGOOSE. It whets its bladed tail on rocks for battle."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"For many generations, it has feuded with ZANGOOSE. It whets its bladed tail on rocks for battle."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"For many generations, it has feuded with ZANGOOSE. It whets its bladed tail on rocks for battle."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"In battle, it uses its bladed tail to counter any ZANGOOSE. It secretes a deadly venom in its tail."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"In battle, it uses its bladed tail to counter any ZANGOOSE. It secretes a deadly venom in its tail."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Le rival historique de Mangriff. Il affûte la lame de sa queue sur les rochers avant le combat."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"For many generations, it has feuded with Zangoose. It whets its bladed tail on rocks for battle."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Le rival historique de Mangriff. Il affûte la lame de sa queue sur les rochers avant le combat."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"For many generations, it has feuded with Zangoose. It whets its bladed tail on rocks for battle."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Constant polishing makes the edge of the blade on its tail extremely sharp. It’s Zangoose’s archrival."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Constant polishing makes the edge of the blade on its tail extremely sharp. It’s Zangoose’s archrival."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il rivalise avec Mangriff grâce à la lame affûtée de sa queue qui sécrète un puissant venin."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Hace frente a Zangoose con su agilidad y su afilada cola, que está cargada con un veneno letal."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"In battle, it uses its bladed tail to counter any Zangoose. It secretes a deadly venom in its tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"猛毒が 染み出している 鋭い 切れ味の 尻尾で 素早い ザングースに 立ち向かう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il affûte la lame de sa queue sur des rochers pour la rendre bien tranchante. Le rival de longue date de Mangriff."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Le une una relación de enemistad con Zangoose. Se lima con las rocas su cola en forma de espada para tenerla afilada."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Constant polishing makes the edge of the blade on its tail extremely sharp. It’s Zangoose’s archrival."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"尻尾の 刀は いつも 岩で 研いでいるので 切れ味 ばつぐん。 ザングースとは 因縁の あいだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Séviper se querelle avec Mangriff depuis plusieurs générations. Ses cicatrices sont les preuves de ses nombreux combats. Ce Pokémon attaque à l’aide de sa queue, aiguisée comme une épée."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Seviper lleva años de gran enemistad con Zangoose. Las cicatrices que tiene por todo el cuerpo dan buena muestra de los encarnizados combates en los que se han enfrentado. Seviper ataca usando su cola con forma de espada."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Seviper shares a generations-long feud with Zangoose. The scars on its body are evidence of vicious battles. This Pokémon attacks using its sword-edged tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"先祖代々 ザングースと 戦ってきた。 体の キズは 激しい 戦いの 印。 鋭い 切れ味の 尻尾で 攻撃するぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La queue tranchante comme un sabre de Séviper a deux fonctions : elle peut frapper l’ennemi et lui injecter un poison qu’il sécrète. Ce Pokémon n’oublie jamais sa vieille rancune envers Mangriff."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Seviper tiene una cola que parece una espada y le sirve para dar un sablazo al enemigo y para envenenarlo. Este Pokémon se mantiene firme en la enemistad que siente hacia Zangoose."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Seviper’s swordlike tail serves two purposes—it slashes foes and douses them with secreted poison. This Pokémon will not give up its long-running blood feud with Zangoose."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"刀の ような 尻尾は 敵を 切り裂くのと 同時に 染み出した 猛毒を 浴びせるぞ。 宿敵 ザングースと 戦い 続ける。"}],"varieties":[{"id":336,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"level-up",36],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",36],[18,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",36],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[5,"egg",0],[6,"egg",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"egg",0],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"egg",0],[9,"egg",0],[10,"egg",0],[11,"egg",0],[13,"tutor",0],[14,"egg",0],[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0],[25,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"wrap","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",